Explanation: Block everything by default in multiverse, except NVIDIA.
Package: *
Pin: release c=multiverse
Pin-Priority: -1

Package: /.*nvidia.*/
Pin: release c=multiverse
Pin-Priority: 500

Explanation: Block everything by default in restricted, except NVIDIA and Broadcom.
Package: *
Pin: release c=restricted
Pin-Priority: -1

Package: /.*(nvidia|broadcom).*/
Pin: release c=restricted
Pin-Priority: 500